WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.364 --> 00:00:05.864
(salsa music)

00:00:09.466 --> 00:00:11.967
(scooter vrooming)

00:00:11.967 --> 00:00:13.917
- What's up Believe Nation, happy weekend!

00:00:13.917 --> 00:00:15.261
How you doing?

00:00:15.261 --> 00:00:18.374
I wanted to share something that

00:00:18.374 --> 00:00:19.501
I did for the wife.

00:00:19.501 --> 00:00:21.607
Actually Nina suggested
that we make a video on this

00:00:21.607 --> 00:00:24.006
'cause we needed something
to share with you guys

00:00:24.006 --> 00:00:25.575
so this was her idea.

00:00:25.575 --> 00:00:27.098
- I look very tall in here.

00:00:27.098 --> 00:00:30.535
- It's 'cause you're on your toes.

00:00:30.535 --> 00:00:32.982
Yep, I knew it.

00:00:32.982 --> 00:00:34.942
I knew she was on her toes, I knew that.

00:00:34.942 --> 00:00:36.222
Nina likes plants.

00:00:36.222 --> 00:00:39.831
Our entire condo is full of plants,

00:00:39.831 --> 00:00:41.414
and as soon as they get too full

00:00:41.414 --> 00:00:43.430
she gives some away to friends

00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:46.848
so that she can grow more plants.

00:00:46.848 --> 00:00:47.681
Right?

00:00:47.681 --> 00:00:49.208
- Kind of, not really.

00:00:49.208 --> 00:00:50.074
- What?

00:00:50.074 --> 00:00:52.800
Even today we had friends
over and she gave them

00:00:52.800 --> 00:00:54.889
dirt to go home with.

00:00:54.889 --> 00:00:57.416
Nina loves her plants,
and in the winter time,

00:00:57.416 --> 00:01:01.481
it's harder because she
can't grow as much stuff.

00:01:01.481 --> 00:01:04.937
We have a balcony outside
and she likes to grow stuff,

00:01:04.937 --> 00:01:06.424
but in the winter obviously
you can't do that.

00:01:06.424 --> 00:01:09.949
So, I decided to do
something special for her

00:01:09.949 --> 00:01:13.101
and help build her a little indoor...

00:01:13.101 --> 00:01:14.125
- Plant.

00:01:14.125 --> 00:01:15.108
- It's not an indoor plant.

00:01:15.108 --> 00:01:15.941
- Indoor...

00:01:15.941 --> 00:01:17.471
- Planter, that's the
word we're looking for.

00:01:17.471 --> 00:01:19.839
- No, we actually showed the previous one

00:01:19.839 --> 00:01:23.807
where we asked for help
to grow my plant indoor.

00:01:23.807 --> 00:01:25.286
- [Evan] So we've done this already?

00:01:25.286 --> 00:01:27.175
- But now showing what you have been--

00:01:27.175 --> 00:01:28.300
- You want to show the update?

00:01:28.300 --> 00:01:29.133
- Yeah.

00:01:29.133 --> 00:01:30.290
- Okay this is the update,
this is what I built.

00:01:30.290 --> 00:01:31.640
We got the stand-up desk and at the top

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:34.532
Nina has her keyboard
that she plays piano on.

00:01:34.532 --> 00:01:37.492
And then underneath we've got these

00:01:37.492 --> 00:01:41.366
growing lights and a big grow light

00:01:41.366 --> 00:01:45.544
and then in here she's growing her plants

00:01:45.544 --> 00:01:46.712
that are just starting to come up.

00:01:46.712 --> 00:01:47.992
What are you growing in here?

00:01:47.992 --> 00:01:50.552
- [Nina] This one is the, I think it's

00:01:50.552 --> 00:01:53.320
either cucumber or zucchini.

00:01:53.320 --> 00:01:54.825
Cucumber or zucchini.

00:01:54.825 --> 00:01:55.959
- [Evan] You grew these
all from seed, right?

00:01:55.959 --> 00:01:56.792
- [Nina] Yeah.

00:01:56.792 --> 00:01:57.625
- [Evan] It's all from seed.

00:01:57.625 --> 00:02:00.727
- [Nina] And then this tomato,
tomato, tomato, tomato.

00:02:00.727 --> 00:02:03.152
And kale, kale, kale, kale, kale.

00:02:03.152 --> 00:02:05.912
And then sage, sage.

00:02:05.912 --> 00:02:08.813
And then my avocado plant.

00:02:08.813 --> 00:02:10.061
- [Evan] Oh look at that
thing, it's getting big.

00:02:10.061 --> 00:02:10.894
- [Nina] Yeah.

00:02:10.894 --> 00:02:12.333
- Why don't you stand on the trampoline?

00:02:12.333 --> 00:02:14.582
Look, look how Nina just grew.

00:02:14.582 --> 00:02:17.205
There you go, now you don't
have to stand on your toes.

00:02:17.205 --> 00:02:20.205
So the lesson for this weekend is...

00:02:21.215 --> 00:02:22.886
- Be a good husband.

00:02:22.886 --> 00:02:24.333
(laughing)

00:02:24.333 --> 00:02:26.000
- Be a good husband.

00:02:27.517 --> 00:02:30.693
- Do something good for the wife.

00:02:30.693 --> 00:02:32.126
Okay, what was your lesson?

00:02:32.126 --> 00:02:36.229
- Or just do something
nice for somebody, maybe?

00:02:36.229 --> 00:02:39.409
You know, like wives
can do very nice things

00:02:39.409 --> 00:02:40.813
for their husbands too.

00:02:40.813 --> 00:02:42.173
- I make you yummy food.

00:02:42.173 --> 00:02:44.399
- I think that's very important.

00:02:44.399 --> 00:02:47.012
- Who will cook, cookie--

00:02:47.012 --> 00:02:48.020
- Who will cookie?

00:02:48.020 --> 00:02:51.076
- Who will cook you yummy food every day?

00:02:51.076 --> 00:02:52.660
- She does have yummy
food, you can check out

00:02:52.660 --> 00:02:55.180
her YouTube channel, there's
some good stuff on there.

00:02:55.180 --> 00:02:57.180
Alright, thank you guys for joining us

00:02:57.180 --> 00:03:00.882
in this impromptu amazing short video.

00:03:00.882 --> 00:03:03.060
We believe in you, we hope you continue to

00:03:03.060 --> 00:03:06.740
believe in yourself and
whatever your one word is--

00:03:06.740 --> 00:03:08.165
- We'll see you soon!

00:03:08.165 --> 00:03:09.318
- You got to say much love.

00:03:09.318 --> 00:03:10.604
- [Both] Much love!

00:03:10.604 --> 00:03:11.604
- And we'll see you soon.

00:03:11.604 --> 00:03:13.354
- We'll see you soon.

